 explicit was a genuine but partly optical/regulatory-driven, not credit-quality-driven, improvement. Guidance for FY27: 22-25% AUM growth, ROA of 3%+ near-term, and mid-to-high-teens ROE (15-17%) over the next 8-10 quarters.","trig":[]},"lm":"2025-09","m":4595,"mem":0,"pdd":"","prev_stage":null,"prev_zone_vpe":null,"r":1.7,"s":"NORTHARC","sig":"","sx":{"SMA_50":"295.5","base_count":"","drawdown_from_prev_signal":"","duration_from_prev_signal":"","pct_below_52w_high":"15.0","pct_change_from_prev_signal":"","pivot_close":"","pivot_low":"","stage_changed_since_prev_signal":"","vpe_df_60d_sum":"-2.1","vpe_zone_cumul_df":""},"t":""}},"s":"NORTHARC"}